  md5('math' || '|' || 'Which of these values is the greatest: 2/3, 0.6, 5/8, or 0.58?')::UUID,
  md5('math' || '|' || 'What is the sum of the interior angles of a quadrilateral?')::UUID,
  md5('math' || '|' || 'How many inches are in 4 feet?')::UUID,
  md5('math' || '|' || 'What is 1/4 + 1/3?')::UUID,
  md5('math' || '|' || 'A recipe uses 3 eggs to make 12 pancakes. At the same rate, how many eggs are needed for 20 pancakes?')::UUID,
  md5('math' || '|' || 'Solve for x: (x − 3)/2 = 6')::UUID,
  md5('math' || '|' || 'What is 2/5 ÷ 3/10?')::UUID,
  md5('math' || '|' || 'On a map, 1 inch represents 25 miles. Two cities are 3.5 inches apart on the map. How far apart are they?')::UUID,
  md5('math' || '|' || 'After a 25% discount, a jacket costs $60. What was the original price?')::UUID,
  md5('math' || '|' || 'What is the slope of the line passing through (2, 3) and (6, 11)?')::UUID,
  md5('math' || '|' || 'The area of a circle is 49π square units. What is its circumference, in terms of π?')::UUID,
  md5('math' || '|' || 'A rhombus has diagonals of length 6 and 8. What is its area?')::UUID,
  md5('math' || '|' || 'What is the value of (2/3)²?')::UUID,
  md5('math' || '|' || 'What is 15% of 240?')::UUID,
  md5('math' || '|' || 'Three-fifths of a number is 24. What is the number?')::UUID,
  md5('math' || '|' || 'A box contains 5 red, 3 blue, and 4 green marbles. One is drawn at random. What is the probability that it is NOT blue?')::UUID,
  md5('math' || '|' || 'In the proportion 3/8 = x/40, what is x?')::UUID,
  md5('math' || '|' || 'When a number is increased by 12, the result is three times the number. What is the number?')::UUID,
  md5('math' || '|' || 'The average of four numbers is 15. Three of the numbers are 12, 18, and 20. What is the fourth number?')::UUID,
  md5('math' || '|' || 'How many 3-inch pieces can be cut from a ribbon that is 4 feet long?')::UUID,
  md5('math' || '|' || 'Two vertical angles measure 3x degrees and 75 degrees. What is the value of x?')::UUID,
  md5('math' || '|' || 'If x + 1/x = 5, what is the value of x² + 1/x²?')::UUID,
  md5('math' || '|' || 'What is the units digit of 7 raised to the 25th power?')::UUID,
  md5('math' || '|' || 'A 6-liter mixture is 1/3 alcohol. How many liters of water must be added so that the mixture is 1/4 alcohol?')::UUID,
  md5('math' || '|' || 'What are the solutions of x² − 5x − 14 = 0?')::UUID,
  md5('math' || '|' || 'The length of a rectangle is increased by 20% and its width is decreased by 20%. What happens to the area?')::UUID,
  md5('math' || '|' || 'The interior angles of a regular polygon sum to 1080°. How many sides does the polygon have?')::UUID,
  md5('math' || '|' || 'What is the measure of the smaller angle formed by the hands of a clock at 3:30?')::UUID,
  md5('math' || '|' || 'Ann can finish a job alone in 12 days and Ben can finish the same job alone in 18 days. They work together for 4 days, then Ann leaves. How many more days does Ben need?')::UUID,
  md5('math' || '|' || 'A square garden has an area of 144 square feet. A path 2 feet wide surrounds the garden on all sides. What is the area of the path alone?')::UUID,
